# thesis/docs/ stays ignored by default, but the frozen domain/audit
# documents must be versionable. A directory-level ignore cannot be
# re-included from below, so the rule is the file pattern plus explicit
# negations for exactly these five documents — deliberately NO general
# unignore for arbitrary new files (Domain Approval Wave, 2026-08-25).
thesis/docs/*
!thesis/docs/benchmark-domain-table.json
!thesis/docs/fft-family-consistency.md
!thesis/docs/oracle-audit-calibration-45.md
!thesis/docs/oracle-correctness-audit.md
!thesis/docs/domain-table-approval-report.md

